s to sign a treaty liberating the whole Catkind\u2026 but your kind is still despised and feared, even though they are fierce warriors and skilled pilots. <br><br>You are Captain Mitzi, a mercenary hired to smuggle the ship Curiosity to a remote corner of the galaxy. Turns out the job had more to it than you thought: now you\u2019re running for your lives with the government\u2019s ships hot on your heels! Every encounter has different outcomes and every decision will impact your destiny, so choose wisely: you can be a righteous hero or a vengeful pirate, talk your way out of things like a charming rogue or escape gun blazing.",
